  {
   "id": 770,
   "hub_id": 14048,
   "version": "2.3.0",
   "description": "<p><strong>ONLY FOR SPT 3.11.X</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bad crash site locations for Customs, Woods and Shoreline</li>\n<li>Fixed the crash site spawn probability</li>\n<li>Added a slider to configure chance of crash site having loot (defaults to 100%)</li>\n<li>Added a localization mappings config file for users to change certain text in the mod</li>\n<li>Refactored some old code</li>\n<li>Added some debugging functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let me know if you find any bad crash site locations, with the map name, screenshots and preferably their coordinates if you can</p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1292/samswats-helicopter-crash-sites-arys-reloaded/2.3.0",
