   "description": "<p><strong>ONLY FOR SPT 4.0.3 - 4.0.X</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Refactored code entirely for upcoming Fika support</li>\n<li>Loading HeliCrash assets now occurs on the raid loading screen instead of at game start</li>\n<li>The debug setting “SpawnAllCrashSites” is now hidden under the Advanced Settings</li>\n</ul>\n",
